# Testing

- Naming: `test_[module_or_feature].py`. Prefer **`parameterized`** cases; keep deps to torch/numpy when possible; otherwise list optional deps and update `tests/min_tests.py` `exclude_cases`.
- Do not commit large binary test data.
- Prefer scoped module tests before full suites.

## Where tests live (by archetype)

| Archetype | Test path | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Transforms | `tests/transforms/` | Pair array + dict (`d`) files |
| Losses | `tests/losses/` | Mirror a neighbor loss test |
| Metrics | `tests/metrics/` | Lifecycle: construct → call → `aggregate()` |
| Network blocks | `tests/networks/blocks/` | Cover **2D and 3D** under `eval_mode` |

## Local runs (examples)

- `./runtests.sh --quick --unittests`
- `python -m tests.transforms.test_<name>`
- `python -m tests.losses.test_<name>`
- `python -m tests.metrics.test_<name>`
- `python -m tests.networks.blocks.test_<name>`

**Source of truth:** `CONTRIBUTING.md` (Unit testing), `docs/cursor-kit/monai-refs/testing.md`, `tests/transforms/test_scale_intensity.py`, `tests/losses/test_logcosh_dice_loss.py`, `tests/metrics/test_median_absolute_error.py`, `tests/networks/blocks/test_layerscale.py`
